# Build context of docker/orin/Dockerfile is docker/orin itself (build.sh: a
# git archive of docker/orin at the commit). Allowlist: only what the
# Dockerfile COPYs from this context. The sources, scripts/export_yolo_engine.sh,
# SOURCES and CAR_SYNC.json come from the `src` context (stage_sources.sh), the
# binary inputs from `inputs`. compose*.yaml, host/, checks/, thor_capture/ and
# the manifest are run-side or report files and stay out of the build.
*
!keys/ros-snapshots.asc
!ros_packages.txt
!constraints.txt
!gateway-requirements.txt
!entrypoint.sh
!set_installed_params.py
!build_checks.sh
!cargo_lock_check.py
!container
